{"id":"start/account","locale":"en","title":"Merchant Account","content":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"что-такое-личный-кабинет","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"What Is the Merchant Account"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Merchant Account"},{"type":"text","text":" is a comprehensive tool for managing transactions, receipts, analytics, and documents. Access to the Merchant Account is provided when you connect "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"CloudPayments"},{"type":"text","text":" and/or "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"CloudKassir"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"","alt":"ChatGPT Image 14 сент. 2026 г., 22_20_29.png","title":null,"width":76,"height":null,"assetPath":"editor-assets/ed9faed0-c443-4b0e-99b0-c8a0b3affd83.png","scriptNote":"","align":"center"}},{"type":"docButton","attrs":{"label":"Merchant Account","href":"https://merchant.cloudpayments.ru/","width":240,"height":56,"fontSize":18,"align":"center","fullWidth":false}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-92858179-e1ac-4b16-9013-912ce1db74f7","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"What You Can Do in the Merchant Account"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Generate reports"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Analyze sales and transaction statistics"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Monitor transactions and process refunds"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Create payment links, add new websites, and configure payment widgets"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stay up to date with the latest CloudPayments news"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"And much more"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-972b7fba-9ba8-4321-8532-7ac444db64d8","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Getting Started with the Merchant Account"}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"start":1,"type":null},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sign in using the link you receive when you connect "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"CloudPayments"},{"type":"text","text":" and/or "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"CloudKassir"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the websites where you plan to accept online payments."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Add team members and assign them roles for collaboration. "}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-ec2a3891-061d-4e35-b7b1-1ee5a9aeb2f8","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"How the Merchant Account Helps Your Business"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The CloudPayments Merchant Account includes tools that help you identify growth opportunities and improve business performance."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-ebb9eb48-8549-4699-9fad-4b1c77509a36","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Increase Sales"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-7f014834-db96-400d-95c4-af2147b42cf2","level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Advanced Analytics"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"In the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Statistics"},{"type":"text","text":" section, you can segment customers using a wide range of filters, such as city, payment method, or payment system. These insights help you optimize your sales strategy, increase revenue, and improve other key business metrics."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-cacb2673-daad-4729-bb2b-2daa2afa0ba1","level":4},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Detailed Error Information"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"In the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Transactions"},{"type":"text","text":" section, you can see which payments were successful and which failed. Failed transactions are highlighted in red and include detailed error descriptions explaining why the payment was declined."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, if the customer had insufficient funds or entered incorrect card details, you can share this information with your sales team so they can follow up with the customer and help complete the payment."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-56b62032-182a-4c7d-abc8-fa7f073f56ea","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Increase Conversion"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The more payment options you offer, the higher your conversion rate."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"In the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Websites"},{"type":"text","text":" section, you can enable additional payment methods to reduce cart abandonment and incomplete orders while increasing impulse purchases."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-ad5df9df-3dc5-4e24-8f8c-a05686c64ec2","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Reduce Your Team's Workload"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can add your team members to the CloudPayments Merchant Account and manage their access to different sections."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"This helps automate workflows, improve collaboration, and speed up information sharing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Roles and User Management"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Learn how to secure your Merchant Account with two-factor authentication (2FA), add users, assign roles, and manage team permissions in the CloudPayments Merchant Account."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-bf084977-da29-4475-b792-c612a584f996","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Why Roles Matter"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Roles allow you to control access for different team members and tailor the Merchant Account to their responsibilities."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"For example:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Accountants"},{"type":"text","text":" can access reports and receipts."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Managers"},{"type":"text","text":" can view transactions and analytics."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Technical specialists"},{"type":"text","text":" can manage websites and integrations."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Using roles allows you to:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Restrict access to financial and technical information"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Separate responsibilities across your team"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Reduce the risk of errors when working in the Merchant Account"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The table below shows which sections of the Merchant Account are available to users based on their assigned role. This helps you determine the appropriate level of access for each team member when using CloudPayments."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-d180ea8d-af4c-4221-84e6-bcf03301f26a","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Role-Based Access"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"","alt":"ChatGPT Image 14 сент. 2026 г., 22_26_13.png","title":null,"width":100,"height":null,"assetPath":"editor-assets/331896bb-e8f8-4c43-b1bc-005a861620ea.png","scriptNote":"","align":"center"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-37c0e701-88a0-4700-8247-658f5f1cf441","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Two-Factor Authentication (2FA): What It Is and Why You Need It"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two-factor authentication (2FA) provides an additional layer of security for your account. After entering your password, you'll be asked to verify your identity using a one-time code sent via SMS."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Today, a username and password alone are no longer enough to keep your account secure. This is especially important when your account provides access to payment management and customer data. That's why we've added a second layer of protection to help keep your information safe."}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"If you and your colleagues use the same Merchant Account, we recommend creating a separate user account for each team member."},{"type":"text","text":" It's quick and only takes a minute."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise, only the person whose phone number is linked to the account will be able to sign in."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-233a3c42-e9a2-4d04-86fb-2d514afe3465","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"How to Grant Access and Add a User in the Merchant Account"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"","alt":"ChatGPT Image 14 сент. 2026 г., 22_29_19.png","title":null,"width":100,"height":null,"assetPath":"editor-assets/3b458caf-8062-4d0a-95a4-9eda01f8c7d7.png","scriptNote":"","align":"center"}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://merchant.cloudpayments.ru/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","class":null,"title":null}}],"text":"Merchant Account "},{"type":"text","text":"→ Users → Add User"}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"start":1,"type":null},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Enter the user's full name. "}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Select a role."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure website access."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Enter the user's email address (required). An invitation email with a sign-in link will be sent to this address."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Подробная инструкция "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://static.cloudpayments.ru/docs/kak_sozdat_akkaunt_dlya_sotrudnika.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","class":null,"title":null}},{"type":"underline"}],"text":"по ссылке →"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"For detailed instructions, see the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://static.cloudpayments.ru/docs/kak_sozdat_akkaunt_dlya_sotrudnika.pdf","target":"_new","rel":"noopener","class":"decorated-link","title":null}},{"type":"bold"}],"text":"User Account Creation Guide"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"мобильное-приложение","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Мобильное приложение"}]},{"type":"image","attrs":{"src":"","alt":"Снимок экрана — 2026-09-14 в 15.35.04.png","title":null,"width":100,"height":null,"assetPath":"editor-assets/d8059cf7-64da-43b8-9926-da387656d28e.png","scriptNote":"","align":"center"}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"CloudPayments теперь в вашем телефоне"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Мы запустили мобильное приложение для "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"iOS и Android"},{"type":"text","text":". Следите за бизнесом и управляйте ключевыми операциями из любой точки — даже когда компьютера нет рядом."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"В приложении можно:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"контролировать платежи, возвраты и заказы;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"просматривать данные по транзакциям;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"получать важные уведомления;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"быстро связываться с поддержкой."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Все главное по бизнесу — всегда под рукой."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"center"}}]},"updated":"2026-09-14T19:32:45.951Z","baseHtml":""}